# App Store Connect setup (copy to ASC_SETUP.local.md — gitignored)

Fill after creating the app in https://appstoreconnect.apple.com

| Field | Where to find | Value |
|-------|----------------|-------|
| Apple ID (email) | Account you use for ASC | |
| Team ID | developer.apple.com → Membership | |
| ASC App ID (numeric) | ASC → App → App Information → Apple ID | |
| Bundle ID | Must match | `com.lnkup.marketplace` |
| App name | ASC | LNKup |
| SKU | ASC create form | lnkup-marketplace |

## ASC API key (preferred for `eas submit`)

1. ASC → Users and Access → Integrations → App Store Connect API
2. Create key (App Manager or Admin)
3. Download `.p8` once → put in `secrets/` (gitignored)
4. Record Key ID + Issuer ID in `eas-submit.local.json` (from example)

## Privacy URLs (must resolve)

- Privacy: https://thelnkup.com/privacy
- Support: https://thelnkup.com/contact
- Terms: https://thelnkup.com/terms

## Note
Confirm privacy URL resolves before review (was 404 on thelnkup.com/privacy).
